      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i keep getting these weird spikes in my head right before things happen. like i'll get this instant mathematical certainty that a stock is gonna drop or someone's gonna trip or something. its like i can see the probability curve shifting in real time. i want to try and map these spikes to actual data so i can turn this into a proper predictive model. can u help me figure out how to structure the dataset for these intuitive inputs?",
